BT /F2 18 Tf 54 776 Td (Personal Trainer Observability Platform - Intern ) Tj ET
BT /F2 18 Tf 54 762 Td (Onboarding Guide) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 726 Td (Purpose of this platform) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 696 Td (This repository runs a complete observability and reliability platform for the `trainer-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 682 Td (api` service.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 652 Td (The goal is not only to know whether a container is up. The goal is to understand ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 638 Td (whether users are getting a reliable service, how deployments affect reliability, and ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 624 Td (how engineers move from a symptom to the root cause.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 594 Td (The platform uses the LGTM stack:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 564 Td (- Loki for logs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 550 Td (- Grafana for dashboards and exploration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 536 Td (- Tempo for distributed traces.) Tj ET
