BT /F2 14 Tf 54 646 Td (Dashboard 1: Unified Observability) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 616 Td (This is the most important dashboard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 586 Td (Use it when a service seems slow, broken, or noisy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td (Panels:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 526 Td (- Request Rate: shows traffic by route and status code.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 512 Td (- Error Rate: shows the ratio of 5xx responses.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 498 Td (- Latency p50/p95/p99: shows request duration percentiles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 484 Td (- Correlated Logs: shows Loki logs from `trainer-api`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 470 Td (- Recent Traces: shows Tempo traces.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 440 Td (How to use it:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 410 Td (1. Generate traffic with `curl http://localhost:8080/workout`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 396 Td (2. Generate latency with `curl "http://localhost:8080/workout?delay_ms=1200"`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 382 Td (3. Open the Unified Observability dashboard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 368 Td (4. Look for a latency spike.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 354 Td (5. Open the logs panel for the same time range.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 340 Td (6. Find a log line with `trace_id`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 326 Td (7. Click the `trace_id` link.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 312 Td (8. Grafana opens the matching Tempo trace.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 298 Td (9. Inspect spans to identify the slow operation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 268 Td (This dashboard proves the platform goes beyond simple up/down monitoring.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 232 Td (Dashboard 2: SLO & Error Budget) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 202 Td (Use this dashboard to know whether the service is meeting reliability promises.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 172 Td (Panels:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 142 Td (- Availability SLI 30d: percentage of successful health probes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 128 Td (- Latency SLI p95: successful request p95 latency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 114 Td (- Success SLI 5m: percentage of non-5xx requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 100 Td (- Error Budget Remaining: how much allowed unreliability remains.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 86 Td (- Burn Rate Fast / Slow: how quickly the error budget is being consumed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 72 Td (- SLO Compliance 7d / 30d: short and longer-term availability.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
