BT /F1 10 Tf 54 768 Td (Key idea:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738 Td (An SLI is the measurement. An SLO is the target. The error budget is the allowed ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 724 Td (failure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 694 Td (Example:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 648 Td (99.5% availability over 30 days allows 0.5% failure.) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 634 Td (30 days = 720 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 62 620 Td (0.5% of 720 hours = 3.6 hours allowed failure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 574 Td (How to use it:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 544 Td (1. Check whether SLI values are above their SLO targets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 530 Td (2. Check whether error budget remaining is healthy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 516 Td (3. If burn rate rises, open Unified Observability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 502 Td (4. Use logs and traces to identify the cause.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 488 Td (5. Follow the `runbooks/slo-burn.md` guidance if an alert fires.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54 452 Td (Dashboard 3: DORA Metrics) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (Use this dashboard to understand delivery performance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 392 Td (Panels:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 362 Td (- Deployment Frequency: how often successful deployments happen.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 348 Td (- DORA Classification: Elite, High, Medium, or Low.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 334 Td (- Lead Time for Changes: time from commit to deployment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 320 Td (- Change Failure Rate: percentage of deployments that fail or require recovery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 306 Td (- Deployment Outcomes: success/failure/cancelled deployment counts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 292 Td (- MTTR: average time to restore service after incidents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 278 Td (- Lead Time Trend: change delivery speed over time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 248 Td (How to use it:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 218 Td (1. Set `GITHUB_REPOSITORY`, `GITHUB_TOKEN`, and `DEPLOYMENT_WORKFLOW_NAME` for live ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 68 204 Td (GitHub Actions metrics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 190 Td (2. Trigger normal deploy workflow from GitHub Actions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 176 Td (3. Trigger failing workflow when testing the Game Day deployment failure scenario.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 162 Td (4. Watch deployment counts and change failure rate update.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 148 Td (5. Investigate alerts when CFR exceeds the threshold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 118 Td (If GitHub credentials are not set, the DORA exporter emits fallback metrics so the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 104 Td (dashboard still loads for demos.) Tj ET
endstream
